  "extract": "V&A Dundee is a design museum in Dundee, Scotland, which opened on 15 September 2018. The V&A Dundee is the first design museum in Scotland and the first Victoria and Albert museum outside London. The V&A Dundee is also the first building in the United Kingdom designed by Kengo Kuma, whose vision was for a 'living room for the city'.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>V&amp;A Dundee</b> is a design museum in Dundee, Scotland, which opened on 15 September 2018. The V&amp;A Dundee is the first design museum in Scotland and the first Victoria and Albert museum outside London. The V&amp;A Dundee is also the first building in the United Kingdom designed by Kengo Kuma, whose vision was for a 'living room for the city'.</p>"
